### Assessment — Task quality Approved

Task 6A closes both load-bearing predecessor findings without weakening the
calibrated isolation boundary, schema-v1 reader behavior, one-shot send path, or
fail-closed treatment of pre-commit schema-v2 terminal histories. The terminal
origin anchor is complete and atomic, the recovery mutation order is safe, and
the prescribed regressions exercise the relevant failure and tamper boundaries.

